  "details": "I'm usually 2 or 3 menus deep in my radial menu and I have to press the back button a fair few times (and remember how deep I was) to get to what I want to click next in my radial menu, or at worst go back and forth a bit to select a couple things over and over. Is there any possibility of getting a favorites menu for the radial menu? I'm thinking, Hold B Button → Second Radial Menu expands outwards where you can select just 5 or 6 favorites. Thank you.",
